# How Features Must Be Built

When asked to build a game or feature:

- Break it into clearly defined systems
- Implement each system as a standalone ModuleScript
- Keep dependencies minimal, explicit, and injected where possible
- Assume every system will be reused in future games

Core systems to always think in:
- Round / match flow
- Player spawning & elimination
- RNG / chance logic
- Finish detection & winners
- Currency & rewards
- Shop systems
- Pets, auras, cosmetics
- Spectating
- DataStore saving/loading
- UI logic (strictly separated from game logic)
